  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Effortless Print Removal"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The carefully optimized handle angle allows the blade to slide into the narrow gap under stubborn prints with minimal effort, making it easier to lift and remove prints."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Safe, Controlled Handling"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The ergonomically designed handle provides stable force support and effective leverage. Its specially engineered structure sits flush against the build plate, reducing the risk of scratches or damage. A free replacement blade ensures long-lasting sharpness and a smooth, safe removal experience."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Premium Design & Comfortable Grip"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Machined from a single piece of aluminum alloy for long-term durability, the finely finished surface provides a secure, comfortable grip that works equally well for both left- and right-handed use, making print removal easier and giving you more control."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Easy Storage On Metal Surfaces"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Integrated magnets provide secure storage and quick access on metal surfaces. Their orientation is carefully engineered to avoid magnetic interference with the build plate while ensuring force is directed to keep the magnets firmly seated, reducing the risk of detachment. A silicone sleeve covers the blade after use to prevent accidental cuts and keep you safe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Direct Magnetic Mounting on Metal Panel"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Magnetic Mounting Using Steel Plate (Plastic Panels)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "DIY Handle Customization"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The handle is compatible with 3D printed decorative components, allowing users to customize the scraper without affecting functionality or structural integrity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The model is available on MakerWorld with downloadable files and detailed information."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Effortless Print Removal</span></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The carefully optimized handle angle allows the blade to slide into the narrow gap under stubborn prints with minimal effort, making it easier to lift and remove prints.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/b53197dfef4c46079959e04d06cdf8a8/11.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/b53197dfef4c46079959e04d06cdf8a8/11.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Safe, Controlled Handling</span></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The ergonomically designed handle provides stable force support and effective leverage. Its specially engineered structure sits flush against the build plate, reducing the risk of scratches or damage. A free replacement blade ensures long-lasting sharpness and a smooth, safe removal experience.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/d8f5d0c0daf9416c8f84f39075c0dd2f/22.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/d8f5d0c0daf9416c8f84f39075c0dd2f/22.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 --><!---卖点2--->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Premium Design &amp; Comfortable Grip</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Machined from a single piece of aluminum alloy for long-term durability, the finely finished surface provides a secure, comfortable grip that works equally well for both left- and right-handed use, making print removal easier and giving you more control.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/78dcf44f08764c7ea158c3d3741bb846/1.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/78dcf44f08764c7ea158c3d3741bb846/1.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 --><!---卖点3--->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Easy Storage On Metal Surfaces</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Integrated magnets provide secure storage and quick access on metal surfaces. Their orientation is carefully engineered to avoid magnetic interference with the build plate while ensuring force is directed to keep the magnets firmly seated, reducing the risk of detachment. A silicone sleeve covers the blade after use to prevent accidental cuts and keep you safe.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-icpc\" style=\"padding: 0;\"><!-- 不同分辨率分栏数量 pct_grad-分栏数量-设备 --> <!-- 替换下一行 -->\n<div class=\"pct_icpc pct_grad-2-pc pct_grad-1-mobile\"><!-- 第1条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><em><span style=\"display: inline !important;\">Direct Magnetic Mounting on Metal Panel</span></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 视频 --> <video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/376ca6af7dc34f508892b9497f0d436a/LEFT.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/376ca6af7dc34f508892b9497f0d436a/LEFT.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/7e71f41312904c1485600f03231e3cbf/LEFT.png\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第2条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><em><span style=\"display: inline !important;\">Magnetic Mounting Using Steel Plate (Plastic Panels)</span></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 视频  --> <video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/a6dbff57b352489d99faad7f8e0f2c4c/RIGHT.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/a6dbff57b352489d99faad7f8e0f2c4c/RIGHT.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/0131ee4d754c49ba992b07832d4a8bc5/RIGHT.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 --><!---卖点4--->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">DIY Handle Customization</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The handle is compatible with 3D printed decorative components, allowing users to customize the scraper without affecting functionality or structural integrity.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/2a470ddf49c04040bf9de32cb49ddd69/4.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/2a470ddf49c04040bf9de32cb49ddd69/4.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><em><span style=\"display: inline !important;\">The model is available on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/2444627-mag-alloy-scraper-diy-part#profileId-2682975\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">MakerWorld</a> with downloadable files and detailed information.</span></em></span></p>\n</div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><br/>What's in the box</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Mag-Alloy Scraper * 1 <br/>Extra Blade * 1<br/>Adhesive-Backed Steel Plate* 1</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br/><!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 38px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody><!-- 第一行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 192.305px;\"><b>Materials</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 59.7656px;\">Aluminum alloy</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 141.406px;\"><b>Packaging Size</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 123.32px;\">200*88*40mm</td>\n</tr>\n<!-- 第二行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 192.305px;\"><b>Color</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 59.7656px;\">Silver</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 141.406px;\"><b>Packaging Weight</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 123.32px;\">0.083 Kg</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The carefully optimized handle angle allows the blade to slide into the narrow gap under stubborn prints with minimal effort, making it easier to lift and remove prints.\n\nThe ergonomically designed handle provides stable force support and effective leverage. Its specially engineered structure sits flush against the build plate, reducing the risk of scratches or damage. A free replacement blade ensures long-lasting sharpness and a smooth, safe removal experience.\n\nMachined from a single piece of aluminum alloy for long-term durability, the finely finished surface provides a secure, comfortable grip that works equally well for both left- and right-handed use, making print removal easier and giving you more control.\n\nIntegrated magnets provide secure storage and quick access on metal surfaces. Their orientation is carefully engineered to avoid magnetic interference with the build plate while ensuring force is directed to keep the magnets firmly seated, reducing the risk of detachment. A silicone sleeve covers the blade after use to prevent accidental cuts and keep you safe.\n\nDirect Magnetic Mounting on Metal Panel\n\nMagnetic Mounting Using Steel Plate (Plastic Panels)\n\nThe handle is compatible with 3D printed decorative components, allowing users to customize the scraper without affecting functionality or structural integrity.\n\nThe model is available on MakerWorld with downloadable files and detailed information.",
